flowchart TD
  accTitle: Request admission, correction and original collection
  accDescr: The player selects intent. Software stages the request. A certified no-admission refusal permits a new explicit decision. Admitted or uncertain work retains original collection. Machine timing is separate evidence.
  P[Player chooses intent and evidence] --> S[SDK retains immutable request]
  S --> W[One mission writer]
  W -->|Typed and request-bound refusal| N[Known not admitted]
  N -->|Inspect reason and current context| P
  W -->|Durable operation| C[Collect original result]
  S -->|Lost or unproved response| U[Uncertain original delivery]
  U --> C
  C --> E[Inspect visible effect and choose next goal]
  E --> P
  W -. After writer finalization .-> J[Existing machine timing journal]
  J -. Offline evidence only .-> A[Service clocks and missing samples]
